  "description": "In this empire, the position of saint sees a high turnover... Because the saints just won't stop sleeping with the knights! So when the new saint Alisa finds out her personal guard is the very man who had her predecessors excommunicated, she's determined to keep her distance. But one day, the two find themselves trapped in a mysterious room forcing them to act out a rather risqué scenario in order to get out. How will the righteous holy knight deal with this decidedly sinful situation?\n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\n *Note: Note: Part of Metatoon's Sunae Danpyeonseon (순애 단편선) Collection.*",
